# ClearFlow MVP — Environment Variables
#
# ClearFlow ships as a STATIC EXPORT (output: 'export') to GitHub Pages. There
# is no server at runtime, so the admin gate is enforced client-side and the
# password is compiled into the bundle at build time. Because a NEXT_PUBLIC_*
# value is visible to anyone who inspects the built JavaScript, this gate is a
# lightweight demo lock, NOT real security — do not use it to protect anything
# sensitive.
#
# Set this to enable the /admin dashboard (client-side pilot stats + leads held
# in the browser). If it is left unset, /admin renders a clear "admin disabled"
# state instead of hanging on a request.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ADMIN_PASSWORD=your-demo-password-here
